  m_Name: Courier Hayes
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ScriptableObjects.TrueEncounterData
  vendorName: Courier Hayes
  offerText: Take this heavy, unmarked lead box. I cannot say what is inside, nor
    can I pay you right now. Just hide it in your room for the night.
  acceptResultText: You hide the ominous, heavy box in your corner. You spend the
    hour sweating profusely, wondering if it's a bomb or something worse.
  rejectResultText: You slam the door on the shady courier. You feel incredibly smart
    avoiding obvious criminal trouble.
  acceptedDelayedText: "Hayes returns and opens the box\u2014it is filled with untraceable
    gold! He gives you a massive cut for your loyalty and takes the box away."
  rejectedDelayedText: The police violently raid your room! Hayes dumped the illegal
    package at your doorstep, and the authorities fine you heavily for possessing
    it.
